    "de": [
      "In the heart of the medieval village of Désaignes, classified as a \"village of character\", L'Âne Têtu offers a vegetarian cuisine with local, seasonal and environmentally friendly ingredients which become the basis of an exclusive taste experience."
    ],
    "ru": [
      "In the heart of the medieval village of Désaignes, classified as a \"village of character\", L'Âne Têtu offers a vegetarian cuisine with local, seasonal and environmentally friendly ingredients which become the basis of an exclusive taste experience."
